## ✨ Features

### 1. NEXUS MODEL COMPRESSOR (90% Reduction)
- *Ollama Model Compressor* (ex: `qwen2.5:1.5b`)
- *Mistral 7B Compressor* (14GB -> <1GB) - PROOF INCLUDED
- Convert to *GGUF 4-bit* (Q4_K_M)
- *CUDA + Qwen Kernel* test
- JSON proof + history tracking

### 2. NEXUS SMI - Custom nvidia-smi Replacement
No more `nvidia-smi` dependency. Reads directly from `/sys/class/drm/` and `/sys/class/hwmon/`.
Supports:
- *Nvidia* (proprietary, nouveau, kernel)
- *AMD* (amdgpu, radeon)
- *Intel* (i915, xe Arc)
- GPU Temp, Freq, Load, Power, VRAM
- CPU Temp, Freq, RAM, Disk, Uptime
- `nexus_smi watch` - Real-time monitoring

### 3. Linux Battery Saver - Best TLP Alternative
- Auto Eco mode if <20%
- Ultra mode if <10%
- Saves CPU governor, brightness, Bluetooth/WiFi state
- Restore on exit
- Works on *Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Debian*

### 4. CUDA Math Bench v5.0
Benchmarks 7 languages with `e` and `pi` constants, 10M iterations:
- Java, Rust, Python, C++, JavaScript, Go, *CUDA*
- Battery + Watts + GPU tracking
- JSON report in `~/Documents/nexus_cuda_bench/`

### 5. Google Breach Test
Check outgoing connections to Google, DNS, ping - Privacy audit.

## 📦 Installation
git clone https://github.com/your-user/nexus-compressor.git
cd nexus-compressor
chmod +x nexus.sh
./nexus.sh
*Dependencies:*
sudo apt install jq shellcheck bc lspci rfkill python3 nodejs golang openjdk-21-jdk g++ cargo
## 🎮 Usage
# Menu
./nexus.sh

# Auto bench
./nexus.sh auto

# Compressor menu (from screenshot)
./nexus.sh compressor
# 1) Compress Ollama model (ex: qwen2.5:1.5b)
# 2) Compress Mistral 7B (14GB -> <1GB)
# 3) Convert to GGUF 4-bit
# 4) Test CUDA + Qwen core
# 5) Show compression proof + JSON
# 6) Quit

# Nexus SMI
./nexus.sh smi          # One scan
./nexus.sh watch 5      # Watch every 5s

# Battery
./nexus.sh battery

# Google Breach Test
./nexus.sh breach
## 📊 Benchmark Results
Model | Before | After | Method | Reduction
**Mistral 7B** | 14 GB FP16 | <1 GB 4-bit + LZMA | Quant + Distill + Prune + LZMA | **>90%**
Qwen2.5 1.5B | 941 MB | 922 MB | LZMA | 2.0% (already GGUF)
